\begin_deeper
\begin_layout Standard
Let 
\begin_inset Formula $\pi\in\Delta(Z)$
\end_inset

.
 
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
A\equiv\{\alpha\in[0,1]:\pi\succsim\alpha\overline{\pi}+(1-\alpha)\underline{\pi}\}
\]

\end_inset

and
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
B\equiv\{\alpha\in[0,1]:\alpha\overline{\pi}+(1-\alpha)\underline{\pi}\succsim\pi\}
